          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask how many speakers before an on-site recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard": {
      "comment": "Microphone mode name, as Control Centre calls it.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno einrichten": {
      "comment": "Title of the onboarding window.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up Steno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno nimmt Meetings auf und transkribiert sie auf diesem Mac. Dafür braucht es drei Berechtigungen und einmal die Modelle.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding subtitle.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno records meetings and transcribes them on this Mac. For that it needs three permissions and, once, the models."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno schreibt ausschließlich in den Ordner, den du unter „Einstellungen → Allgemein“ auswählst. Ausnahme: die Modelle liegen unter „Library/Application Support/Steno“. Nichts verlässt diesen Mac.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding footer.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno writes only into the folder you choose under Settings → General. The one exception is the models, which live in Library/Application Support/Steno. Nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno-Einstellungen": {
      "comment": "Title of the settings window.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno: Aufnahme läuft, %@": {
      "comment": "Accessibility description of the menu bar icon while recording; %@ is mm:ss.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno: recording, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno: Verarbeitung": {
      "comment": "Accessibility description of the menu bar icon while processing.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno: processing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno: Verarbeitung, %d %%": {
      "comment": "Accessibility description of the menu bar icon while processing, with progress.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno: processing, %d %%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno: bereit": {
      "comment": "Accessibility description of the idle menu bar icon.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno: ready"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Systemaudio": {
      "comment": "Permission name.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
