          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "missing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS gibt die Bildschirmaufnahme erst nach einem Neustart von Steno frei.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding detail for the screen recording permission.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS only grants screen recording after Steno is restarted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "noch nie": {
      "comment": "Shown instead of a date when no update check has run yet.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "never"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v3 ist mehrsprachig, Deutsch inbegriffen. v2 ist älter und schneller.": {
      "comment": "Explains the ASR version picker.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "v3 is multilingual, German included. v2 is older and faster."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Änderungsschwelle, Display mit der Maus": {
      "comment": "Settings label.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change threshold, display with the pointer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Änderungsschwelle, normales Display": {
      "comment": "Settings label.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change threshold, other displays"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Öffnen": {
      "comment": "Button that opens the Login Items settings pane.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@-Meeting erkannt. Aufnehmen und transkribieren?": {
      "comment": "Suggestion panel headline before the meeting has a name. %@ is the app, e.g. Teams.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A %@ meeting was detected. Record and transcribe it?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "„%1$@“ in %2$@ erkannt. Aufnehmen und transkribieren?": {
      "comment": "Suggestion panel headline once the meeting's name is known. %1$@ is the meeting title, %2$@ the app.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” in %2$@ was detected. Record and transcribe it?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erkennung": {
      "comment": "Settings tab: which apps are watched for microphone use.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jedes erkannte Meeting wird einmal vorgeschlagen. Ohne Antwort verschwindet der Vorschlag nach 20 Sekunden und gilt als abgelehnt.": {
      "comment": "Settings, detection tab: what happens after a meeting is detected.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every detected meeting is offered once. With no answer the suggestion disappears after 20 seconds and counts as declined."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speichert Screenshots der Bildschirme und liest den Fenstertitel, um das Meeting zu benennen.": {
      "comment": "One-sentence explanation of the screen recording permission.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saves screenshots of your displays and reads the window title to name the meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
